🎮 QUICK USAGE WORKFLOW (5 Steps)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Step 1: REGISTER PARTICIPANTS
├─ Click: "➕ Register Participant"
├─ Fill in:
│  ├─ Name: e.g., "Alice Johnson"
│  ├─ Email: e.g., "alice@example.com"
│  └─ Skills: Select at least one (e.g., React, JavaScript)
├─ Click: "Register"
└─ See: "✓ Alice Johnson registered successfully!"

Step 2: REPEAT FOR MORE PARTICIPANTS
├─ Register 5-10 participants with different skills
├─ Stats update: "6 Total Participants"
└─ See participants appear in Dashboard

Step 3: RUN CLUSTERING
├─ Click: "🔄 Run Clustering"
├─ Set:
│  ├─ Team Size: 4 (or your preference)
│  └─ Event ID: 1 (default)
├─ Click: "Run Clustering"
└─ Wait: Algorithm runs (1-2 seconds)

Step 4: VIEW RESULTS
├─ Click: "Teams" tab
├─ See: Auto-generated teams with members
├─ Verify: Skill balance across teams
└─ Notice: Teams are automatically balanced!

Step 5: EXPORT & SHARE
├─ Click: "📥 Export Participants"
├─ Download: participants.csv
├─ Click: "📥 Export Teams"
├─ Download: teams.csv
└─ Use: In Excel, share with participants


