💾 HOW DATA WORKS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Storage Location:
  • Browser memory (RAM)
  • Not on disk
  • Not on any server

Persistence:
  • While browser tab is open: ✅ Yes
  • After page refresh: ❌ No
  • When browser closes: ❌ No

To Save Permanently:
  • Use "📥 Export" buttons
  • Download CSV files
  • Save on your computer
  • Can re-import later if needed


